            <div xml:id="d321">

                <pb facs="0645" n="579" sameAs="frus:frus1931-41v02/pg579"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">711.94/2244<hi rendition="#superscript"
                    >9/11</hi></note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Japanese Ambassador</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >Nomura</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of State</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1941-08-29">August 29, 1941</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Dear Mr. Secretary</hi>: I have just received word
                    from Tokyo to avoid publicity as much as possible concerning our
                    conversations.</p>
                <p>I am told that my Government, for various considerations, feels that secrecy at
                    this time is essential for the success of the conversations. I desire,
                    therefore, to request your cooperation in this regard.</p>
                <p>Yours faithfully,</p>
                <closer><signed>K. <hi rendition="#small-caps">Nomura</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
